WifiDisplayDevice (Miracast wireless displays)         |\n87: |       │                                                                                                |\n88: |       ├──> DisplayModeDirector    (Refresh rate 60/120Hz, resolution arbitration)                      |\n89: |       └──> DisplayPowerController (DisplayPowerState, PhotonicModulator thread, ColorFade)             |\n90: +===================================================╪====================================================+\n91:                                                     │ SurfaceControl.Transaction:\n92:                                                     │   - setDisplayLayerStack(displayToken, layerStack)\n93:                                                     │   - setDisplayProjection(displayToken, orient, rect...)\n94:                                                     │   - setDisplayPowerMode(displayToken, mode)\n95: +===================================================▼====================================================+\n96: |                              [Composition Core: SurfaceFlinger & CompositionEngine]                    |\n97: |                                                                                                        |\n98: |  SurfaceFlinger (Main Service State Machine)                                                           |\n99: |       │                                                                                                |\n100: |       ├──> mDisplays map: std::map<IBinder /*token*/, sp<DisplayDevice>>                               |","truncated_fields":["content"]}
